From ccdcfa595c78b2de9b2f97adde9d41ed3f385aeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:51:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] S4-K: result card: Granny's pose cut under the bubble,
 the grade stamp in parts (sparkles, star apart), tests

Granny's raised arms reach under the speech bubble's bottom rows, which the bubble covers (it is drawn after her): her baked pose is cut at the body's bottom (plat_cook_pose top, cook_pose_crop), so a new pose no longer redraws the bubble body and the window under it. The grade stamp is four parts (ring and word, two sparkles, star; fc_grade_stamp_part): the sparkles change every second tick and with one layer redrew the title, money pill and the bubble too; the left sparkle is drawn only right of the bubble's edge and the ring's one column on that edge is put right with the bubble's edge colour. Exact: native stage on / off 5,140 frames x 2 sizes x day / night + Spanish identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvDzgwv9nxsL8r6tWV
